        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>手写笔记 OCR</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    background: #f5f5f0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .page {\n    background: #fff;\n    width: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 24px 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #ccc;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n  }\n  /* ---- spiral divider ---- */\n  .spiral {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 18px;\n    margin: 14px 0;\n    background: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      90deg,\n      #aaa 0px, #aaa 4px,\n      transparent 4px, transparent 18px\n    );\n    border-top: 2px solid #888;\n    border-bottom: 2px solid #888;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n  }\n\n  /* ===== TOP HALF ===== */\n  .top-half {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 190px 1fr 200px;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n\n  /* LEFT column (top) */\n  .col-left-top {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    padding-right: 6px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n  .col-left-top .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #222;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .col-left-top .indent1 { padding-left: 12px; }\n  .col-left-top .indent2 { padding-left: 24px; }\n  .arrow-down {\n    display: block;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    color: #555;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .boxed-red {\n    border: 1.5px solid red;\n    padding: 2px 4px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    color: red;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .red { color: red; }\n  .blue { color: #1a1aff; }\n  .pink { color: #cc44aa; }\n  .purple { color: #7700cc; }\n  .underline { text-decoration: underline; }\n\n  /* MIDDLE column (top) */\n  .col-mid-top {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n  }\n  .col-mid-top .block-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    margin-bottom: 3px;\n  }\n  .boxed-block {\n    border: 1.5px solid #333;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n  }\n  .boxed-block-red {\n    border: 1.5px solid red;\n    padding: 4px 6px;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: #c00;\n  }\n\n  /* RIGHT column (top) */\n  .col-right-top {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    padding-left: 6px;\n    border-left: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n  .col-right-top .main-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;\n  }\n  .dots-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 4px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #333; display: inline-block; }\n\n  /* ===== BOTTOM HALF ===== */\n  .bottom-half {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr 200px;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .col-left-bot {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    padding-right: 6px;\n    border-right: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n  .col-mid-bot {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    padding: 0 6px;\n  }\n  .col-right-bot {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    padding-left: 6px;\n    border-left: 1px solid #ddd;\n  }\n\n  /* arrows used in bottom half */\n  .arrow-left {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    color: #cc44aa;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n\n  /* numbered / bulleted items */\n  .num { font-weight: bold; }\n  .indent1 { padding-left: 12px; }\n  .indent2 { padding-left: 24px; }\n  .indent3 { padding-left: 36px; }\n\n  p { margin-bottom: 2px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- ============ TOP HALF ============ -->\n  <div class=\"top-half\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT column top -->\n    <div class=\"col-left-top\">\n      <p class=\"section-title\">三、防御固守阵地</p>\n      <p>XX/Z，已占优势，确</p>\n      <p>保XX/Z，CDHIK</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">组织积极防御</p>\n      <span class=\"arrow-down\">↓</span>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">巩固阵地</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">　守住阵地</p>\n      <br>\n      <p>(1) 不能被动挨打，积极抗</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">击敌人进攻，消耗敌有</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">生力量</p>\n      <br>\n      <p>5.攻击力</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">不能蛮干，要积极主动</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">地想办法，克服困难，</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">完成任务</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MIDDLE column top -->\n    <div class=\"col-mid-top\">\n      <p class=\"block-title\">2.近距离突击</p>\n      <div class=\"boxed-block\">\n        <p>中共部队：</p>\n        <p>二、近距离突击 — 以近距离</p>\n        <p>接触来歼灭敌人，避免被</p>\n        <p>敌火力优势所压制</p>\n      </div>\n      <br>\n      <p><span class=\"num\">1.</span>一般来说：距敌 D 米以内</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">展开突击，</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">(一)结合地形：利用地形地物</p>\n      <p class=\"indent2\">接敌运动</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">(火力掩护)：以机枪，炮兵</p>\n      <p class=\"indent2\">配合步兵进攻</p>\n      <br>\n      <div class=\"boxed-block-red\">\n        <p>以近战胜过远战，</p>\n        <p>夜战胜过昼战，</p>\n        <p>近战夜战是解放军</p>\n        <p>战术精髓之一</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT column top -->\n    <div class=\"col-right-top\">\n      <p class=\"main-title\">三、防御固守阵地</p>\n      <div class=\"dots-row\">\n        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n        <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <p>防御：<span class=\"red\">确保要点</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">掌握预备队</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">积极防御</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\"><span class=\"red\">坚守阵地</span></p>\n      <p>一、<span class=\"underline\">要求守住阵地</span>，消耗</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">敌人有生力量</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">G：积极防御，不消</p>\n      <p class=\"indent2\">极等待</p>\n      <br>\n      <p><span class=\"blue\">—积极防御要注意</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\"><span class=\"blue\">结合地形构筑工事</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\"><span class=\"blue\">布置兵力火器</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\"><span class=\"blue\">设置障碍物</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\"><span class=\"blue\">组织联合火力</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">以上措施综合运用，</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">形成完整防御体系</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div><!-- end top-half -->\n\n  <!-- ===== SPIRAL DIVIDER ===== -->\n  <div class=\"spiral\"></div>\n\n  <!-- ============ BOTTOM HALF ============ -->\n  <div class=\"bottom-half\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT column bottom -->\n    <div class=\"col-left-bot\">\n      <p>(一) <span class=\"red\">战斗编成</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">以主力部队构成</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">第一梯队</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">预备队配置于后</p>\n      <p>(II) 部队区分</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">突击集团：</p>\n      <p class=\"indent2\">担任突击方向</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">牵制集团：</p>\n      <p class=\"indent2\">牵制敌人</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">后备集团：</p>\n      <p class=\"indent2\">用于发展胜利</p>\n      <br>\n      <p>(III) 突击方向选择</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">选择敌薄弱环节</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">迂回包围</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">断敌退路</p>\n      <br>\n      <p><span class=\"red\">注意：</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">集中兵力于主要</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">突击方向</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">以少量兵力</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">牵制其他方向</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- MIDDLE column bottom -->\n    <div class=\"col-mid-bot\">\n      <p>(II) <span class=\"red underline\">攻击战术要点</span></p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">以火力压制敌人</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">步兵在火力掩护下</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">向敌冲击</p>\n      <br>\n      <p>大范围运动迂回，</p>\n      <p>以一部兵力正面</p>\n      <p>牵制，主力从侧翼</p>\n      <p>或背后突击</p>\n      <br>\n\n      <!-- boxed area with arrows -->\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:6px; margin-top:6px;\">\n        <div>\n          <div class=\"boxed-block\" style=\"border-color:#cc44aa; color:#c00; min-width:160px;\">\n            <p><span class=\"pink\">战术核心：</span></p>\n            <p>以近战夜战</p>\n            <p>为主要手段</p>\n            <p>集中优势兵力</p>\n            <p>各个歼灭敌人</p>\n          </div>\n          <p style=\"margin-top:4px; font-size:11px;\">\n            <span class=\"arrow-left\">←</span>\n            <span class=\"pink\">各个歼灭敌人</span>\n          </p>\n          <p style=\"font-size:11px;\">\n            <span class=\"arrow-left\">←</span>\n            <span class=\"pink\">是我军战术基本原则</span>\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"boxed-block\" style=\"min-width:140px; border-color:#333;\">\n          <p>大范围运动，</p>\n          <p>迂回包围，</p>\n          <p>断敌退路，</p>\n          <p>再予以歼灭</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT column bottom -->\n    <div class=\"col-right-bot\">\n      <p>(一) <span class=\"blue\">战斗编成(0)</span> 强调</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">发挥整体战斗力</p>\n      <p>(2) 指挥与协同</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">加强各兵种协同</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">步炮协同、步坦协同</p>\n      <br>\n      <p>(1) <span class=\"red\">1969年以后</span>，中共</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">军队推行合成化</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">建设，提高诸兵种</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">合成作战能力</p>\n      <br>\n      <p>十 十 十</p>\n      <p>各部队按战役任务</p>\n      <p>编成诸兵种合成</p>\n      <p>作战单元</p>\n      <br>\n      <p>至</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">以合成化提升</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">整体作战效能，</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">是现代战争的</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">必然要求</p>\n      <p class=\"indent1\">下</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div><!-- end bottom-half -->\n\n</div><!-- end page -->\n</body>\n</html>"
